# Story 3.1: Total the report rows

Status: Draft

## Story
As an analyst, I want row totals, so that I can reconcile a statement.

## Acceptance Criteria
- AC-1 (P0): Given rows, when totalled, then the sum of amounts is returned.
- AC-2 (P3): Given a total, when displayed, then it is formatted with a currency symbol.

## Tasks / Subtasks
- [ ] total the rows (AC: 1, 2)
